  "limitations": "Rectangular 2D finite real data, at most 64 rows/columns and 4096 pixels. No image file reading, background estimation, PSF fitting, segmentation, nonfinite-value masking or units. Signed intensities are accepted and can place a centroid outside the image. Absolute included total below 1e-30 is an error.",
  "port_notes": "Ports the 2D finite/masked branch of centroid_com: sum(index*data)/sum(data), reversed to x,y order. Upstream undefined NaN output for near-zero total becomes a structured error. Nonfinite pixels are rejected, not automatically masked.",
